(7542398, 1207406, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a treat!  A stylish, understated take on impressionism.  She''s superbly backlit, her garment a diaphanous revelation.  That pink absolutely brings the image to a simmer.  The title drives our understanding, and brings drama and weight to the moment.  She''s not ordering a pizza with extra cheese.  The soft focus works well to allow her some privacy.  A real tour de force.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'What a treat!  A stylish, understated take on impressionism.  She''s superbly backlit, her garment a diaphanous revelation.  That pink absolutely brings the image to a simmer.  The title drives our understanding, and brings drama and weight to the moment.  She''s not ordering a pizza with extra cheese.  The soft focus works well to allow her some privacy.  A real tour de force.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2017-11-04 16:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542434, 1207076, 76217, '<td valign="top">Magnificent desolation. The highlights are brilliant. Pressing boundaries in highlights, shadows, and processing, but exquisitely hyper-fastidious.</td>', 'Magnificent desolation. The highlights are brilliant. Pressing boundaries in highlights, shadows, and processing, but exquisitely hyper-fastidious.', '2017-11-04 22:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542435, 1207421, 76217, '<td valign="top">Very sharp. Great attention to detail. This is what I aspire to. This photo best meets the challenge description. It is an artful blend.</td>', 'Very sharp. Great attention to detail. This is what I aspire to. This photo best meets the challenge description. It is an artful blend.', '2017-11-04 22:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542437, 1206933, 97225, '<td valign="top">I love the look of this. Top few.</td>', 'I love the look of this. Top few.', '2017-11-04 22:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542439, 1207201, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ''painting''.</td>', 'Beautiful ''painting''.', '2017-11-04 22:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542504, 1206935, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific homage to van Gogh''s "Starry Night."  The blue and yellow "paint" cinch the intention, though "Starry Night" also brings in some green and, which doesn''t at all detract from my admiration, is less garish.  The composition is successful, with the apparent depth of field playing out attractively behind the people in the foreground. The buildings on the right side of the street have an appealing cubist quality, which contributes to the transition from realistic figures to the abstract, dreamy night sky.  We can see from the umbrellas that it''s raining.  A pleasant ambiguity arises in the sky -  are those blue-yellow dabs stars or raindrops?  <br/>A wonderful effort and result.</td>', 'Terrific homage to van Gogh''s "Starry Night."  The blue and yellow "paint" cinch the intention, though "Starry Night" also brings in some green and, which doesn''t at all detract from my admiration, is less garish.  The composition is successful, with the apparent depth of field playing out attractively behind the people in the foreground. The buildings on the right side of the street have an appealing cubist quality, which contributes to the transition from realistic figures to the abstract, dreamy night sky.  We can see from the umbrellas that it''s raining.  A pleasant ambiguity arises in the sky -  are those blue-yellow dabs stars or raindrops?  A wonderful effort and result.', '2017-11-05 11:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542506, 1207410, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely and calm, a celebration of sky and light.  I like how the brush strokes work in the very pretty vegetation, but in the road and sky they seem a bit overpowering.  The sky is uplifting with beautiful clouds and peachy sunrise or sunset.  I wonder why the yellow doesn''t extend to the right of the sun as it does to the left, but guess that that''s just how it was.  My quibbling aside, I think this is a fine image that, if hanging on the wall, would bring pleasure on a daily basis.</td>', 'Lovely and calm, a celebration of sky and light.  I like how the brush strokes work in the very pretty vegetation, but in the road and sky they seem a bit overpowering.  The sky is uplifting with beautiful clouds and peachy sunrise or sunset.  I wonder why the yellow doesn''t extend to the right of the sun as it does to the left, but guess that that''s just how it was.  My quibbling aside, I think this is a fine image that, if hanging on the wall, would bring pleasure on a daily basis.', '2017-11-05 11:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542507, 1207239, 173844, '<td valign="top">Seemingly simple but very interesting, visceral image.  I can actually feel in my stomach the ocean swell in the foreground.  The sun and its reflection seem so bright that I instinctively avert my gaze.  The smudged sailboat balances the scene, but hardly plays a part in this grandeur.  The painterly treatment is modest and quite successful.  Fine work.</td>', 'Seemingly simple but very interesting, visceral image.  I can actually feel in my stomach the ocean swell in the foreground.  The sun and its reflection seem so bright that I instinctively avert my gaze.  The smudged sailboat balances the scene, but hardly plays a part in this grandeur.  The painterly treatment is modest and quite successful.  Fine work.', '2017-11-05 12:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542513, 1206935, 100831, '<td valign="top">You night like this too .  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oxHnRfhDmrk" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Don McLean</a></td>', 'You night like this too .  Don McLean', '2017-11-05 12:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542520, 1207300, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing treatment of a very pleasing scene.  If that sounds wishy-washy,  not in the least -  pleasing, to me, is a valued aspect of a photo, as it is linked with pleasure.  (and why does spell-check offer, in preference, wish-washy, washy-washy, dishy-washy, wispy-washy and fishy-washy?).  The modestly impressionistic treatment yields a congenial result.  An interesting composition as the buildings zigzag through the image, surrounded by trees and topped by a pale blue sky.  Fine image.</td>', 'Very pleasing treatment of a very pleasing scene.  If that sounds wishy-washy,  not in the least -  pleasing, to me, is a valued aspect of a photo, as it is linked with pleasure.  (and why does spell-check offer, in preference, wish-washy, washy-washy, dishy-washy, wispy-washy and fishy-washy?).  The modestly impressionistic treatment yields a congenial result.  An interesting composition as the buildings zigzag through the image, surrounded by trees and topped by a pale blue sky.  Fine image.', '2017-11-05 13:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542533, 1207076, 173844, '<td valign="top">The bold lines and light are transfixing.  The foreground white walls massively advance towards the viewer.  The view through the opening is mostly blocked by a slanted plane of grid-like buildings, which further abstracts the image into a geometric study.  The neutral palette, so nicely nuanced, is perfectly sparked by the colorful artwork at the end of the passageway.  The painterly effect is just modest enough to take the edge off reality.  An intricate, deftly handled marvel.<br/>Another favorite of this challenge.</td>', 'The bold lines and light are transfixing.  The foreground white walls massively advance towards the viewer.  The view through the opening is mostly blocked by a slanted plane of grid-like buildings, which further abstracts the image into a geometric study.  The neutral palette, so nicely nuanced, is perfectly sparked by the colorful artwork at the end of the passageway.  The painterly effect is just modest enough to take the edge off reality.  An intricate, deftly handled marvel.Another favorite of this challenge.', '2017-11-05 14:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542547, 1206972, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great feel of time and place in this very attractive image.  The limited palette yields a lush and sensuous result.  Golden light suffuses the entire scene and might be said to be the real subject.  Terrific perspective.  Has the feel of a classic painting.  A small, subjective note is that the texture of the canvas comes through rather strongly.</td>', 'Great feel of time and place in this very attractive image.  The limited palette yields a lush and sensuous result.  Golden light suffuses the entire scene and might be said to be the real subject.  Terrific perspective.  Has the feel of a classic painting.  A small, subjective note is that the texture of the canvas comes through rather strongly.', '2017-11-05 14:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542550, 1207180, 173844, '<td valign="top">A very pretty, happy scene.  I like the unusual composition of a vast wall of flowers grudgingly revealing some people on the path to the left.  The spiky, crystalline treatment of the image works well for the flowers, though is, I think, a bit dicey for the figures.  Very enjoyable.</td>', 'A very pretty, happy scene.  I like the unusual composition of a vast wall of flowers grudgingly revealing some people on the path to the left.  The spiky, crystalline treatment of the image works well for the flowers, though is, I think, a bit dicey for the figures.  Very enjoyable.', '2017-11-05 15:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542568, 1207270, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine-looking landscape and seascape.  The colors are rich and sustaining.  Although it''s a scene of great breadth it''s still intimate, I suppose because the trees invite you in and then you''re led step by step into the distance.  The clouds and sky are varied and interesting.  The painterly processing is more than harmonious, it enhances look and mood of the image.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Fine-looking landscape and seascape.  The colors are rich and sustaining.  Although it''s a scene of great breadth it''s still intimate, I suppose because the trees invite you in and then you''re led step by step into the distance.  The clouds and sky are varied and interesting.  The painterly processing is more than harmonious, it enhances look and mood of the image.  Beautiful.', '2017-11-05 17:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542569, 1207192, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely autumn scene.  One can easily be seduced by the colors alone, but it''s a living image, brought to this point by the graceful trees that front the simple road.  In the modest composition the mass of trees to the left are balanced by corresponding road on the right.  The painterly effect appears to be very subtle.</td>', 'Lovely autumn scene.  One can easily be seduced by the colors alone, but it''s a living image, brought to this point by the graceful trees that front the simple road.  In the modest composition the mass of trees to the left are balanced by corresponding road on the right.  The painterly effect appears to be very subtle.', '2017-11-05 17:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542579, 1207118, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is a very stunning scene and very painterly to be sure without actually using a filter, or so it seems.  In my top picks.</td>', 'This is a very stunning scene and very painterly to be sure without actually using a filter, or so it seems.  In my top picks.', '2017-11-05 19:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542580, 1207009, 114285, '<td valign="top">Stunning image  gorgeous sky and beautiful minimalism. Looks like a Judi production. In my top picks.</td>', 'Stunning image  gorgeous sky and beautiful minimalism. Looks like a Judi production. In my top picks.', '2017-11-05 19:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
