(7542582, 1207360, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of photo that I look at and really believe that morning was beautiful to behold.  You must love living where you are. Pretty sure this is Maryann''s photo, and this is my top pick, it''s glorious,  I''ll congratulate you now.</td>', 'This is the kind of photo that I look at and really believe that morning was beautiful to behold.  You must love living where you are. Pretty sure this is Maryann''s photo, and this is my top pick, it''s glorious,  I''ll congratulate you now.', '2017-11-05 19:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542598, 1207402, 173844, '<td valign="top">Filling the frame with these stalks and spiky shoots is a bold statement that people will either like or dislike.  I happen to like it.  It feels like being lost in a corn maze, and having an interactive map, of course.  It has a calligraphic feeling, again hidden.  Interesting and provoative.</td>', 'Filling the frame with these stalks and spiky shoots is a bold statement that people will either like or dislike.  I happen to like it.  It feels like being lost in a corn maze, and having an interactive map, of course.  It has a calligraphic feeling, again hidden.  Interesting and provoative.', '2017-11-05 20:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542599, 1207360, 28742, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. 9</td>', 'Fantastic. 9', '2017-11-05 20:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542600, 1207309, 28742, '<td valign="top">lovely and well done. 7</td>', 'lovely and well done. 7', '2017-11-05 20:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542601, 1207253, 28742, '<td valign="top">Image size is quite small - that''s gonna hurt your score. Colors are nice, scene is pleasant and fairly well captured. Not a fan of the textured processing.</td>', 'Image size is quite small - that''s gonna hurt your score. Colors are nice, scene is pleasant and fairly well captured. Not a fan of the textured processing.', '2017-11-05 20:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542602, 1206948, 28742, '<td valign="top">Because staring down at the concrete boat ramp in front of you is much more interesting than what''s out on the water? Doesn''t do it for me, sorry. Colors are nice, though.</td>', 'Because staring down at the concrete boat ramp in front of you is much more interesting than what''s out on the water? Doesn''t do it for me, sorry. Colors are nice, though.', '2017-11-05 20:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542603, 1207271, 28742, '<td valign="top">Love the fall colors. The stone arches add interest, but not enough to feel like they are the subject, leaving this a bit hard to get excited about. Still worth a 6 from me, though.</td>', 'Love the fall colors. The stone arches add interest, but not enough to feel like they are the subject, leaving this a bit hard to get excited about. Still worth a 6 from me, though.', '2017-11-05 20:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
