(7542651, 1207406, 28742, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and stunning. Not a fan of the phone part, but I guess that''s the story you''re telling here, so won''t knock you for it. 10</td>', 'Beautiful and stunning. Not a fan of the phone part, but I guess that''s the story you''re telling here, so won''t knock you for it. 10', '2017-11-05 21:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
