(7542655, 1207323, 173844, '<td valign="top">Startling, graphic distillation of this spiral staircase.  Reminds me of an inner view of a chambered nautilus.</td>', 'Startling, graphic distillation of this spiral staircase.  Reminds me of an inner view of a chambered nautilus.', '2017-11-05 21:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542656, 1207033, 28742, '<td valign="top">This has the uniquely artistic feel of an authentic <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/1031.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/1031.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/1031.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=1031" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">GeneralE</a>. Take that as a compliment, regardless.</td>', 'This has the uniquely artistic feel of an authentic  GeneralE. Take that as a compliment, regardless.', '2017-11-05 21:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542657, 1207184, 28742, '<td valign="top">I''ve been criticizing textures on other entries, but I feel like you used it properly and usefully here - mostly on the white, not very noticeably on the darker areas. Just my taste, anyway. Regardless of the outcome, this is a fantastic dog portrait for it''s owner.</td>', 'I''ve been criticizing textures on other entries, but I feel like you used it properly and usefully here - mostly on the white, not very noticeably on the darker areas. Just my taste, anyway. Regardless of the outcome, this is a fantastic dog portrait for it''s owner.', '2017-11-05 21:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542658, 1206969, 28742, '<td valign="top">Simplistic in it''s content, artistic in it''s processing, the combination of it all make it a masterpiece. 9</td>', 'Simplistic in it''s content, artistic in it''s processing, the combination of it all make it a masterpiece. 9', '2017-11-05 21:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542659, 1207364, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great motion in this somewhat hectic image.  It feels more like running than walking.  Maybe I should say exciting rather than hectic, as it also evokes the sense of being chased through these sunny, pretty woods.  It''s a fine scene and an interesting concept.</td>', 'Great motion in this somewhat hectic image.  It feels more like running than walking.  Maybe I should say exciting rather than hectic, as it also evokes the sense of being chased through these sunny, pretty woods.  It''s a fine scene and an interesting concept.', '2017-11-05 21:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542660, 1207419, 28742, '<td valign="top">The chair, interesting as it may be, is lost in the scene with the heavy processing.</td>', 'The chair, interesting as it may be, is lost in the scene with the heavy processing.', '2017-11-05 21:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542662, 1207105, 28742, '<td valign="top">I would be inclined to brighten the whole thing up a bit and crop about 25% off the top for a beautiful panorama. 7</td>', 'I would be inclined to brighten the whole thing up a bit and crop about 25% off the top for a beautiful panorama. 7', '2017-11-05 21:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542663, 1207033, 173844, '<td valign="top">Jarring and electric, this edgy image holds together rather nicely.  The figures are comfortably placed and the composition is complex, organized on the basis of color as much as physical form.  Strong photograph. And thanks for the frame.</td>', 'Jarring and electric, this edgy image holds together rather nicely.  The figures are comfortably placed and the composition is complex, organized on the basis of color as much as physical form.  Strong photograph. And thanks for the frame.', '2017-11-05 21:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542666, 1207386, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like all the flickering detail and the attention to the humble grass and undergrowth, just as important as towering oaks and spreading fields of poppies.  I also appreciate the mating of wildly dissimilar artists.  But I do find it a bit washed out, though I believe the over-exposure is a deliberate artistic statement.</td>', 'I like all the flickering detail and the attention to the humble grass and undergrowth, just as important as towering oaks and spreading fields of poppies.  I also appreciate the mating of wildly dissimilar artists.  But I do find it a bit washed out, though I believe the over-exposure is a deliberate artistic statement.', '2017-11-05 21:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542667, 1206948, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sharp, assertive image that, though starkly realistic, also has an abstract feel due to the bold shapes and colors.  What a good eye is at work here.  The lighting effects are beautifully handled.  Fine stuff.</td>', 'Sharp, assertive image that, though starkly realistic, also has an abstract feel due to the bold shapes and colors.  What a good eye is at work here.  The lighting effects are beautifully handled.  Fine stuff.', '2017-11-05 21:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542670, 1206935, 114285, '<td valign="top">Always love to see a good rainy day pic and the filter that you used is incredibly funky. I can definitely see this in a cafe, maybe you should sell it to them. In my top picks.</td>', 'Always love to see a good rainy day pic and the filter that you used is incredibly funky. I can definitely see this in a cafe, maybe you should sell it to them. In my top picks.', '2017-11-05 21:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542671, 1206968, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how there is only the suggestion of an umbrella, and only the suggestion of a painting.</td>', 'I like how there is only the suggestion of an umbrella, and only the suggestion of a painting.', '2017-11-05 21:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542672, 1206931, 2333, '<td valign="top">6</td>', '6', '2017-11-05 22:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542673, 1207406, 50641, '<td valign="top">really like this except for the phone, wish she just had a headache, i mean, not really, but to improve the drama ;-)</td>', 'really like this except for the phone, wish she just had a headache, i mean, not really, but to improve the drama ;-)', '2017-11-05 22:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542674, 1207419, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of this processing but I''m giving you a 7 because it works with this shot. Still, I think a more subtle application would be better.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of this processing but I''m giving you a 7 because it works with this shot. Still, I think a more subtle application would be better.', '2017-11-05 22:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
