(7542690, 1207031, 173844, '<td valign="top">Some might say the painterly treatment here is over the top, but I like how it brings out interests contrasts.  It''s an interesting take on a quiet moment in an everyday scene.</td>', 'Some might say the painterly treatment here is over the top, but I like how it brings out interests contrasts.  It''s an interesting take on a quiet moment in an everyday scene.', '2017-11-05 22:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542692, 1207407, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine foreground, strong and brightly colored in a dry zone, backed by the varied blues of water, mountains and sky.  Nice western feel.  The choppy texture in the sky is a bit distracting.  Very attractive, though, overall.</td>', 'Fine foreground, strong and brightly colored in a dry zone, backed by the varied blues of water, mountains and sky.  Nice western feel.  The choppy texture in the sky is a bit distracting.  Very attractive, though, overall.', '2017-11-05 22:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542695, 1207201, 173844, '<td valign="top">Expressive and intimate moment with the focus on the women nicely advanced by lightening and fading out the surrounding scene.  The painterly treatment simplifies detail into solids and planes. Enjoyable and warm.</td>', 'Expressive and intimate moment with the focus on the women nicely advanced by lightening and fading out the surrounding scene.  The painterly treatment simplifies detail into solids and planes. Enjoyable and warm.', '2017-11-05 22:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542696, 1207291, 173844, '<td valign="top">Heightened and a bit garish, but I like the straightforward flair, the colors, the wide perspective and the dancing sky.  Unabashedly sure of itself. Very enjoyable.</td>', 'Heightened and a bit garish, but I like the straightforward flair, the colors, the wide perspective and the dancing sky.  Unabashedly sure of itself. Very enjoyable.', '2017-11-05 22:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542697, 1207048, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and dreamy.  I love the colors.</td>', 'Beautiful and dreamy.  I love the colors.', '2017-11-05 22:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542698, 1206933, 114285, '<td valign="top">Well now  how can this not be appreciated for being what it is, the classic European restaurant image. Front page stuff.</td>', 'Well now  how can this not be appreciated for being what it is, the classic European restaurant image. Front page stuff.', '2017-11-05 22:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542699, 1207180, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very painterly indeed.  I love the pop of colors.</td>', 'Very painterly indeed.  I love the pop of colors.', '2017-11-05 22:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542700, 1206972, 67697, '<td valign="top">The colortone gives this such a nostalgic feel.  I love the way the ripples in the water really stand out with the processing.</td>', 'The colortone gives this such a nostalgic feel.  I love the way the ripples in the water really stand out with the processing.', '2017-11-05 22:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542701, 1207097, 67697, '<td valign="top">The boy is the bonus gift of the shot.  He actually does look like a painting!</td>', 'The boy is the bonus gift of the shot.  He actually does look like a painting!', '2017-11-05 22:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542702, 1207279, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful setup.  I love what you did with the processing.</td>', 'Beautiful setup.  I love what you did with the processing.', '2017-11-05 22:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542703, 1207395, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love those curtains!  Beautiful capture of light and shadow.</td>', 'I love those curtains!  Beautiful capture of light and shadow.', '2017-11-05 22:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542704, 1206933, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a perfect scene for this challenge.</td>', 'What a perfect scene for this challenge.', '2017-11-05 22:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542706, 1207310, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love how the processing makes all the pieces blend together.  Beautiful capture of the light too.</td>', 'I love how the processing makes all the pieces blend together.  Beautiful capture of the light too.', '2017-11-05 23:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542707, 1207360, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful scene.  The fog works so well for this moment.  Is the water pretty high right now?  I''m looking at how much is under the swing.</td>', 'What a beautiful scene.  The fog works so well for this moment.  Is the water pretty high right now?  I''m looking at how much is under the swing.', '2017-11-05 23:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542708, 1207368, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a shame to have a boat in this condition.  But the water it is sitting in is quite beautiful.</td>', 'What a shame to have a boat in this condition.  But the water it is sitting in is quite beautiful.', '2017-11-05 23:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542710, 1207271, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty capture of the fall colors.  What is that structure there with the archways?</td>', 'This is a very pretty capture of the fall colors.  What is that structure there with the archways?', '2017-11-05 23:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542712, 1207406, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love every part of this except for that she is on the phone.  Not sure why that bugs me except for maybe the scene seems so primitive and the phone is beyond that basic mode.</td>', 'I love every part of this except for that she is on the phone.  Not sure why that bugs me except for maybe the scene seems so primitive and the phone is beyond that basic mode.', '2017-11-05 23:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542713, 1207239, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love that the boat is just a tiny blur.</td>', 'I love that the boat is just a tiny blur.', '2017-11-05 23:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542728, 1207360, 96751, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Mary Ann!</td>', 'Congrats, Mary Ann!', '2017-11-06 00:08:53.000000', NULL, 0),
