(7542821, 1207414, 173844, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your responsive comment on my comment, which educates me on this tendency of watercolors to often blur in the background. I suppose the paint can be wetter or dryer as it''s applied, or for reasons I''m not aware of.  Mine is a good example of limited knowledge undercutting criticism, sincere as it may be.  Best of all, now I can appreciate your image with fresh eyes.</td>', 'Thank you for your responsive comment on my comment, which educates me on this tendency of watercolors to often blur in the background. I suppose the paint can be wetter or dryer as it''s applied, or for reasons I''m not aware of.  Mine is a good example of limited knowledge undercutting criticism, sincere as it may be.  Best of all, now I can appreciate your image with fresh eyes.', '2017-11-06 07:47:38.000000', NULL, 0),
